{"2873060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Bell Echoes", "steam_appid": 2873060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>· Fight alongside your companions and venture deeper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you will meet a cast of distinctive companions and venture deeper together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New regions will open, new allies will join your party, and new storylines will unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every step forward, you draw closer to their pasts—and to the hidden side of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/4ad9ad8ef27c3b1349508df1b37a33f1.poster.avif?t=1785228792\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/4ad9ad8ef27c3b1349508df1b37a33f1.webm?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/4ad9ad8ef27c3b1349508df1b37a33f1.mp4?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>· Not your usual “move once, attack once” tactics game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a rich and versatile skill set, letting you freely plan an entire turn around your resources and chain multiple abilities together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your three party members link their actions together, a single battle becomes a layered, coordinated offensive of your own making. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2214b8862e8f760d1c099868a016d9e8.poster.avif?t=1785228792\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2214b8862e8f760d1c099868a016d9e8.webm?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2214b8862e8f760d1c099868a016d9e8.mp4?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>· Knockbacks, collisions, terrain, and objects are all weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height, cover, displacement, knockbacks, collisions, and battlefield objects and terrain all have a real impact on combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slam enemies into obstacles, trigger chain reactions through objects, and use terrain to reshape both offense and defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a seemingly limited battlefield can keep opening up new tactical solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/80159055f846a0cf8557161ae1de9ae7.poster.avif?t=1785228792\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/80159055f846a0cf8557161ae1de9ae7.webm?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/80159055f846a0cf8557161ae1de9ae7.mp4?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>· Repeated ventures shape each character’s combat style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you push deeper, your characters continue to grow in new directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Insights can change how abilities function, while talents, equipment, gems, and other upgrades can push the same character toward completely different builds and playstyles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2b394ddc77db81e8da53e08349fc290c.poster.avif?t=1785228792\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2b394ddc77db81e8da53e08349fc290c.webm?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2b394ddc77db81e8da53e08349fc290c.mp4?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/10c111d2da9412d7c3f2833624b84b89.poster.avif?t=1785228792\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/10c111d2da9412d7c3f2833624b84b89.webm?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/10c111d2da9412d7c3f2833624b84b89.mp4?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>· Echoes open the path, memories reveal the truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat powerful enemies and obtain precious Echoes to advance the story and unlock deeper regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep venturing deeper and collect Chapter Memory Fragments to uncover each character’s hidden past—and the deeper secrets of the world itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/35c849c4dc3a8e9b918d860c051eb750.poster.avif?t=1785228792\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/35c849c4dc3a8e9b918d860c051eb750.webm?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/35c849c4dc3a8e9b918d860c051eb750.mp4?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/edbe60d212b0270b5a696f80bdd6e7b5.poster.avif?t=1785228792\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/edbe60d212b0270b5a696f80bdd6e7b5.webm?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/edbe60d212b0270b5a696f80bdd6e7b5.mp4?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact Us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please leave us a message in the Steam discussion group, or send us an email at <a href=\"mailto:382330596@qq.com\">382330596@qq.com</a>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>· Fight alongside your companions and venture deeper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you will meet a cast of distinctive companions and venture deeper together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New regions will open, new allies will join your party, and new storylines will unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every step forward, you draw closer to their pasts—and to the hidden side of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/4ad9ad8ef27c3b1349508df1b37a33f1.poster.avif?t=1785228792\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/4ad9ad8ef27c3b1349508df1b37a33f1.webm?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/4ad9ad8ef27c3b1349508df1b37a33f1.mp4?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>· Not your usual “move once, attack once” tactics game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a rich and versatile skill set, letting you freely plan an entire turn around your resources and chain multiple abilities together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your three party members link their actions together, a single battle becomes a layered, coordinated offensive of your own making. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2214b8862e8f760d1c099868a016d9e8.poster.avif?t=1785228792\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2214b8862e8f760d1c099868a016d9e8.webm?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2214b8862e8f760d1c099868a016d9e8.mp4?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>· Knockbacks, collisions, terrain, and objects are all weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height, cover, displacement, knockbacks, collisions, and battlefield objects and terrain all have a real impact on combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slam enemies into obstacles, trigger chain reactions through objects, and use terrain to reshape both offense and defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a seemingly limited battlefield can keep opening up new tactical solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/80159055f846a0cf8557161ae1de9ae7.poster.avif?t=1785228792\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/80159055f846a0cf8557161ae1de9ae7.webm?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/80159055f846a0cf8557161ae1de9ae7.mp4?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>· Repeated ventures shape each character’s combat style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you push deeper, your characters continue to grow in new directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Insights can change how abilities function, while talents, equipment, gems, and other upgrades can push the same character toward completely different builds and playstyles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2b394ddc77db81e8da53e08349fc290c.poster.avif?t=1785228792\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2b394ddc77db81e8da53e08349fc290c.webm?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2b394ddc77db81e8da53e08349fc290c.mp4?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/10c111d2da9412d7c3f2833624b84b89.poster.avif?t=1785228792\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/10c111d2da9412d7c3f2833624b84b89.webm?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/10c111d2da9412d7c3f2833624b84b89.mp4?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>· Echoes open the path, memories reveal the truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat powerful enemies and obtain precious Echoes to advance the story and unlock deeper regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep venturing deeper and collect Chapter Memory Fragments to uncover each character’s hidden past—and the deeper secrets of the world itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/35c849c4dc3a8e9b918d860c051eb750.poster.avif?t=1785228792\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/35c849c4dc3a8e9b918d860c051eb750.webm?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/35c849c4dc3a8e9b918d860c051eb750.mp4?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/edbe60d212b0270b5a696f80bdd6e7b5.poster.avif?t=1785228792\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/edbe60d212b0270b5a696f80bdd6e7b5.webm?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/edbe60d212b0270b5a696f80bdd6e7b5.mp4?t=1785228792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact Us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please leave us a message in the Steam discussion group, or send us an email at <a href=\"mailto:382330596@qq.com\">382330596@qq.com</a>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The Bell Echoes is a story-driven tactical roguelite. Fight alongside a cast of distinctive companions as you venture deeper into the Corrupted Lands, defeat powerful foes, collect Echoes and memory fragments, and uncover the truth behind the characters and the world.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/c1d53edc1a81d43b2209d968783329563a827dc4/header.jpg?t=1785228792", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/c1badefcfef209795d08b56f4f9fb582b4d77be1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785228792", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/c1badefcfef209795d08b56f4f9fb582b4d77be1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785228792", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Sto